<div class="hero-kicker"><span style="color:#FF9CBE;font-weight:700">HEALTH · OKOA MAMA NA MTOTO</span><span class="dot" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>19 August 2025</span></div><h1>When a budget meeting is <em>a life-saving meeting.</em></h1><p class="hero-sub">The budget-makers of Garissa County sit with the health executive — CECM Health, Chief Officer, Director for Health, Health Committee and Budget Committee members — and deliberate maternal and newborn health together. The field story, told from the room.</p><div class="hero-ctas"><a class="btn btn--pink" href="#story">Read the story<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 5v14M19 12l-7 7-7-7"></path></svg></a><a class="btn btn--ghost" href="/#topics">All topics</a></div><div class="rv fieldnote"><div class="fn-top"><span class="fn-tag">The original post</span><span class="fn-date">@Fountain_FOH · X</span></div><p>“On to the 5th activity of the Okoa Mama na Mtoto initiative — with the CECM Health, Chief Officer Health, Director for Health, Health Committee members at the Assembly and Budget Committee members. A fruitful discussion, and deliberations we agreed upon together.”</p><div class="fn-src">19 Aug 2025 · 683 views · 9 likes · 2 reposts</div></div></div><div class="car-out"><div class="car-count"><b>1</b>/<span>4</span></div><div class="car-arrows"><button class="arrow" aria-label="Previous photo"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 18l-6-6 6-6"></path></svg></button><button class="arrow" aria-label="Next photo"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9 18l6-6-6-6"></path></svg></button></div></div><div class="scroll-cue"><span class="line"></span>Scroll</div></section><section class="page-lead"><div class="wrap page-lead-inner"><p>Every five minutes of the meeting, the same truth holds: a mother’s survival depends on staffed facilities, equipped referral and emergency transport — and all of it rests on county budget decisions. On <strong>19 August 2025</strong>, Okoa Mama na Mtoto took the conversation to the people who write those budgets.</p></div></section><section class="fn-section" id="story"><div class="wrap"><div class="rv fn-head"><div><span class="eyebrow eyebrow--paper">The story, in four frames</span><h2 class="h2">Four frames from <em>the room.</em></h2></div><p class="fn-intro">Captured at the meeting, 19 August 2025. Swipe through the room the way the day unfolded — the table, the deliberation, the assembly committee, the working meeting.</p></div><div class="fn-editorial"><div class="fn-carousel rv"><div class="fn-slides"><div class="fn-slide on"><span class="frame">Frame <!-- -->01<!-- --> /<!-- --> <!-- -->04</span><img alt="The county health leadership table at the OMMI fifth activity meeting" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="60vw" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2FGyucnxiXcAA59gF.jpg&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2FGyucnxiXcAA59gF.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2FGyucnxiXcAA59gF.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2FGyucnxiXcAA59gF.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2FGyucnxiXcAA59gF.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2FGyucnxiXcAA59gF.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2FGyucnxiXcAA59gF.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2FGyucnxiXcAA59gF.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2FGyucnxiXcAA59gF.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2FGyucnxiXcAA59gF.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/><div